    """Join the colleagues already here to the accounts they sign in with.

    By email first, which is exact. Then by full name, because two of the five
    accounts carry no address at all — they were created for people who had
    not been given a mailbox yet. A name match is only accepted when it is
    unique on both sides; anything ambiguous is left for a person to link,
    since guessing wrong here attaches somebody's access to somebody else.
    """
